    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      172.82,
      394.7,
      217.58
    ],
    "text": "Issued by the Natural Hazards Early Warning Centre Issued at 10.00 p.m. 25 October 2026, valid for the next 12 hours.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri",
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      0.9599999785423279,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      142.58,
      220.61,
      472.59,
      234.65
    ],
    "text": "For Multi-day boats in the Bay of Bengal deep sea areas.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      14.039999961853027
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      237.26,
      308.78,
      276.14
    ],
    "text": "Take Action!",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      9.960000038146973,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      279.47,
      541.34,
      403.49
    ],
    "text": "The Depression over East-central and adjoining Southeast Bay of Bengal has intensified into a Deep Depression. It is moved westwards and lay centered at 5.30 p.m. of today, the 25th October, 2026, near Latitude 15.1\u00b0N and Longitude 90.5\u00b0E. The system is very likely to move nearly westwards, and intensify further into a cyclonic storm over East-central and adjoining Southeast Bay of Bengal by 5.30 a.m. of 26th October. Then it is very likely to move west-northwestwards and intensify into a severe cyclonic storm over west-central Bay of Bengal around 5.30 a.m. of 27th October, 2026.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      6.960000038146973,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      414.41,
      542.81,
      460.15
    ],
    "text": "Wind speeds in the sea areas marked under the \u201cWarning\u201d category may increase to 70kmph at times, heavy thundershowers can occur, and the sea conditions in these areas will become very rough.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      479.35,
      542.79,
      822.48
    ],
    "text": "Therefore, Naval and fishing communities are warned not to venture to the sea areas bounded by 10N to 20N latitude and 80E to 95E longitude until further notice. Naval and fishing communities operating in those sea areas are advised to move away from the affected sea areas.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      847.92,
      540.91,
      944.16
    ],
    "text": "Naval and fishing communities engaging the activities over this sea area are advised to be vigilant and be attentive to the future forecasts and bulletins issued by the department of meteorology in this regards.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
